      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This auto-line break feature is really affecting my input. For example, when I type uppercase and lowercase letters, it keeps wrapping to a new line automatically, and the more I switch between uppercase and lowercase, the more frequent the line breaks become. As a result, I constantly have to go back from the login failure page, double-click the input field again, and continue entering the rest of my account and password. Please, I beg the developers to optimize or fix this issue. For someone like me who needs to log in via the SDK many times a day, this is absolute torture. Is there anyone else suffering from this new change like I am?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
